        "filing_date": "2026-04-07",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe that this is a key advantage over our competitors, whether traditional dealers, who do not have a strong online presence, or online-only competitors, who lack the offline infrastructure and in-store experiences that we are able to provide.",
